   "titulo": "I want to do:",
   "texto": [
    "To say you want to do something, you take **ます** off the verb and add **たい です**: **いきます** → **いきたい です** (I want to go), **たべます** → **たべたい です** (I want to eat), **みます** → **みたい です** (I want to see).",
    "It's only for talking about **ti mismo**, or for asking the other one."
